{"about":["Welcome to the beautiful world of mountains! In Alpine - The Simulation Game you can expect a varied story mode with many missions, and all this in the middle of a lovingly designed game world in the snowy Alps.","Get involved to help the guests of the idyllic mountain village of Oberbruck a skiing experience in a class of its own. Then strap on your skis and take your turns on your freshly groomed slope! Expand your ski area by mastering exciting challenges with different","challenges with different vehicles and thus unlock new slopes, lifts and even new areas of the game world.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202108/2506/LS6R98mzBbJh6FLDbtcFNaeH.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202108/2506/LS6R98mzBbJh6FLDbtcFNaeH.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202108/2506/ct0lW9XBMOtu8rTATZTk9SYt.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202108/2506/ct0lW9XBMOtu8rTATZTk9SYt.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202108/2506/1inJ6KCZvG9W45XlelbaoNmQ.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202108/2506/1inJ6KCZvG9W45XlelbaoNmQ.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202401/2511/f1c1eb134451daa67c41f4966b8c68e680b922a2d0312489.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202401/2511/f1c1eb134451daa67c41f4966b8c68e680b922a2d0312489.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/20